{
  "format": "rsl-strategy@1",
  "name": "intraday_vwap_reversion",
  "note": [
    "VWAP REVERSION - acheter l'ecart au VWAP quand il devient extreme,",
    "sortir au retour sur le VWAP.",
    "",
    "Ce que cet exemple montre : la composition `rolling(across=sessions)`",
    "+ `session_lag`, qui mesure une dispersion AU MEME MOMENT DE LA",
    "JOURNEE sur les seances precedentes. Le seuil de deux ecarts-types",
    "signifie donc « inhabituel pour cette heure-ci », et non « inhabituel",
    "dans l'absolu » - la volatilite intraday n'etant pas constante au fil",
    "de la seance, la distinction n'est pas cosmetique.",
    "",
    "Et la grille horaire par `arith %` : une decision tous les quarts",
    "d'heure, en trois noeuds au lieu de vingt comparaisons.",
    "",
    "Aucun essai archive. Forme, pas resultat."
  ],
  "strategy": {
    "ref": "rules@1",
    "params": {
      "quantity": 1,
      "allow_pyramiding": false,
      "rules": {
        "entry_long": {
          "type": "all_of",
          "operands": [
            {
              "type": "all_of",
              "operands": [
                {
                  "type": "compare",
                  "op": ">=",
                  "left": {
                    "type": "session",
                    "field": "minutes_from_open",
                    "lag": 0
                  },
                  "right": {
                    "type": "constant",
                    "value": 30.0
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "compare",
                  "op": "<=",
                  "left": {
                    "type": "session",
                    "field": "minutes_from_open",
                    "lag": 0
                  },
                  "right": {
                    "type": "constant",
                    "value": 330.0
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "compare",
                  "op": "==",
                  "left": {
                    "type": "arith",
                    "op": "%",
                    "left": {
                      "type": "session",
                      "field": "minutes_from_open",
                      "lag": 0
                    },
                    "right": {
                      "type": "constant",
                      "value": 15.0
                    }
                  },
                  "right": {
                    "type": "constant",
                    "value": 0.0
                  }
                }
              ],
              "note": [
                "Grille horaire : une decision toutes les 15 minutes, de la",
                "minute 30 a la minute 330 depuis l'ouverture DECLAREE.",
                "",
                "`arith %` remplace ici douze comparaisons `any_of`. Attention a la",
                "convention : une barre est horodatee a sa CLOTURE, donc",
                "`minutes_from_open` parcourt 1..N et jamais 0. Le point « 30 minutes",
                "apres l'ouverture » est la barre qui SE FERME a cette minute."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "compare",
              "op": "<",
              "left": {
                "type": "arith",
                "op": "-",
                "left": {
                  "type": "arith",
                  "op": "/",
                  "left": {
                    "type": "price",
                    "field": "close",
                    "lag": 0
                  },
                  "right": {
                    "type": "arith",
                    "op": "/",
                    "left": {
                      "type": "cumulative",
                      "stat": "sum",
                      "inner": {
                        "type": "arith",
                        "op": "*",
                        "left": {
                          "type": "arith",
                          "op": "/",
                          "left": {
                            "type": "arith",
                            "op": "+",
                            "left": {
                              "type": "arith",
                              "op": "+",
                              "left": {
                                "type": "price",
                                "field": "high",
                                "lag": 0
                              },
                              "right": {
                                "type": "price",
                                "field": "low",
                                "lag": 0
                              }
                            },
                            "right": {
                              "type": "price",
                              "field": "close",
                              "lag": 0
                            }
                          },
                          "right": {
                            "type": "constant",
                            "value": 3.0
                          }
                        },
                        "right": {
                          "type": "price",
                          "field": "volume",
                          "lag": 0
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "right": {
                      "type": "cumulative",
                      "stat": "sum",
                      "inner": {
                        "type": "price",
                        "field": "volume",
                        "lag": 0
                      }
                    },
                    "note": "VWAP ANCRE sur la seance declaree, sur le prix typique."
                  }
                },
                "right": {
                  "type": "constant",
                  "value": 1.0
                }
              },
              "right": {
                "type": "arith",
                "op": "*",
                "left": {
                  "type": "constant",
                  "value": -2.0
